# .clauderisks
# Sensitive paths Claude should not read, modify, or log contents of.
# These are enforced by .claude/settings.json deny rules and PreToolUse hooks.

## Secret files — never edit, never log contents
apps/api/.env
apps/web/.env.local
.env
.env.production
.env.staging

## Migration history — never edit manually, always use `prisma migrate dev`
apps/api/prisma/migrations/

## Lock files — never edit manually, always let pnpm manage
pnpm-lock.yaml

## Generated files — never edit, always regenerate
apps/api/node_modules/
apps/web/node_modules/
node_modules/
apps/api/dist/
apps/web/.next/

## Infrastructure — changes affect shared services, confirm with user first
infrastructure/docker-compose.yml
